{"title":"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find a formula for\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20da502812c9992f10b0b45bf0e6248b69097ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{\\lfloor \\frac{n}{4} \\rfloor } \\binom{n}{4k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"72\" height=\"55\" /> for any natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/26176a66f4dc305faaec50fb99c74f46d3c9d0fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^n+(1+i)^n+(1-i)^n}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"186\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-